      "url": "https://www.soka.edu/about/institutional-research-and-assessment",
      "summary": "The Office of Institutional Research and Assessment at Soka University of America collects and publishes data on enrollment, graduation, and student outcomes to support institutional planning, regulatory reporting, and transparency for prospective students, families, and researchers. The data includes detailed statistics on undergraduate and graduate admissions, enrollment, graduation rates, and student success metrics. The university maintains an average undergraduate graduation rate of 88% and a graduate program completion rate of 95%. The page provides additional resources such as career reports and links to download the Common Data Set for various years.",
